ingsberättelse\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-ui-caption font-['Inter',system-ui,sans-serif] leading-ui-sm text-[#1E6256]\">\n              ✓ Klart\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex justify-between h-[40px] items-center border-t border-t-solid border-t-[#E6EAF0] border-b border-b-solid border-b-[#E6EAF0]\">\n            <div className=\"text-ui-caption font-['Inter',system-ui,sans-serif] leading-ui-sm [color:#0F172A]\">\n              Noter\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-ui-caption font-['Inter',system-ui,sans-serif] leading-ui-sm text-[#92400E]\">\n              ! 2 av 5 noter saknas\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex items-center pt-ui-sm gap-[12px]\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center h-[28px] shrink-0 px-[12px] rounded-brand-control bg-[#E6EAF0]\">\n              <div className=\"text-ui-caption leading-ui-sm font-['Inter',system-ui,sans-serif] font-[500] text-[#64748B]\">\n                Granska och skicka för signering\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div className=\"text-ui-caption leading-ui-sm font-['Inter',system-ui,sans-serif] text-[#475569]\">\n              Året måste vara avslutat, noterna klara och banken avstämd.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  )"
